// inMST={A}. Heap: [(1,A,B),(3,A,C)]
// Extract (1,A,B). B not in MST. Add B. inMST={A,B}. Push B's edges to non-MST: (2,B,C),(4,B,D)
// Heap: [(2,B,C),(3,A,C),(4,B,D)]
